Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: enable RK3576 Rocket NPU and VDPU383 on NanoPi R76S

Backport Jiaxing Hu's RK3576 Rocket v17 driver, bindings and power domain
series to Linux 6.18.65, including the prerequisite Rockchip IOMMU
clock fix. Keep RK3576 SoC nodes disabled by default and enable
them on the NanoPi R76S with its existing RK806 NPU supply. Add Detlev
Casanova's VDPU383 nodes with the sorted register blocks.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/cover.1794615324.git.gahing@gahingwoo.com/
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/cover.1794615323.git.gahing@gahingwoo.com/
Link: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/841363ebb5082a06c69ac34719e26659fe63dbd6
Link: https://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/2510.2/11027.html
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/linux-media/20260226-vdec-reg-order-rk3576-v4-2-b8d72dc75250@collabora.com/

